  "editorialSummary": "Nothing says civilization is peaking quite like [Meta's record fine](https://english.elpais.com/technology/2026-10-23/metas-annus-horribilis-why-it-was-hit-the-largest-fine-ever-imposed-on-a-tech-company.html) coinciding with [global PHP cybersecurity crises](https://www.npr.org/2026/10/23/g-s1-149503/hacking-php-flaws) and [Volvo slashing thousands of jobs](https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-10-23/the-opening-trade-10-23-2026-video). At this rate, the researchers celebrating a [groundbreaking melanoma vaccine trial](https://www.smh.com.au/national/landmark-moment-sydney-scientist-s-world-first-cancer-breakthrough-revealed-20261023-p6164q.html?ref=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_source=rss_feed) are mostly just looking for somewhere quiet to hide.",
